WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A contract can be signed while the task queue is empty.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
TaskLatch separates selection, contract, assignment and payment.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A fee to unlock work? Pause and verify.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:31.000
The checklist flags a warning; it never declares a company safe or fake.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:42.000
The sample was onboarded. No assignment had been recorded.

6
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Add a task reference and the status changes. Payment still is not assumed.

7
00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Personal open-source demo. Synthetic records. Everything stays in this browser.
